      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1922 entrepreneur Victor Girard Kleinberger bought almost 3,000 acres and founded Girard, the seed of today’s Woodland Hills.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
